<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If you heat with oil in Shediac, your tank has a harder life than most. Salt air off Shediac Bay and the Northumberland Strait speeds up rust on outdoor steel tanks, so a tank that would last comfortably inland can wear out early here. Hub City Tank Co replaces and removes residential oil tanks across Shediac, Pointe-du-Chêne, and the surrounding shore communities.</p><p>Maybe your insurer sent a letter about your tank's age, or you've spotted rust blisters near the bottom seam. Either way, we'll take an honest look and give you a firm written price before any work starts, whether that's a <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-moncton/">tank replacement</a> or a full <a href="/oil-tank-removal-moncton/">removal</a>. We're licensed, insured, and about 20 minutes away in Moncton. Call (506) 802-3471 for a free written estimate.</p></div></div></section>
