        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We swap aging steel tanks for new models that stand up better to Shediac's salt air. Most replacements are done in one day, so you're not left without heat.</p>
